sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as 管理员
    participant Page as adminPage:Admin
    participant Dashboard as dashboard:AdminDashboardService
    participant Users as users:Map
    participant Merchants as merchants:Map
    participant Orders as orders:Map
    participant Logs as logs:List
    participant Store as store:DemoStore
    Admin->>Page: 请求 metrics
    Page->>Dashboard: metrics()
    Dashboard->>Users: count User
    Dashboard->>Merchants: count Merchant
    Dashboard->>Orders: 聚合订单、营收和状态
    Dashboard->>Logs: 读取最近操作日志
    Users-->>Dashboard: userCount
    Merchants-->>Dashboard: merchantCount
    Orders-->>Dashboard: orderCount/revenue/statusStats
    Logs-->>Dashboard: recentLogs
    Dashboard->>Store: 组合 metrics Map
    Store-->>Page: KPI、图表、健康和日志数据
    alt 非 PLATFORM_ADMIN
        Page-->>Admin: 403，无数据泄露
    else 空集合
        Page-->>Admin: 零值或空状态
    end
